{
  "id": "395",
  "title": "When is the Conference?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-10-28",
  "synopsis": "Little Zhang is asked to go to Hangzhou to attend a conference.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/558/af76a9a5078972d9fb7bba00ce2085e6029607cc.mp3?1698352210",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "会议是什么时候？\n\n王总：小张，杭州分公司那边有个会议需要总部的人参加，麻烦你跑一趟。\n小张：好的。会议是什么时候？\n王总：下个月1号。等会儿我把会议的邮件转发给你。\n小张：好的，谢谢王总。",
    "traditional": "會議是什麼時候？\n\n王總：小張，杭州分公司那邊有個會議需要總部的人參加，麻煩你跑一趟。\n小張：好的。會議是什麼時候？\n王總：下個月1號。等會兒我把會議的郵件轉發給你。\n小張：好的，謝謝王總。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "When is the conference?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "王总：小张，杭州分公司那边有个会议需要总部的人参加，",
      "traditional": "王總：小張，杭州分公司那邊有個會議需要總部的人參加，",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng xiǎo zhāng háng zhōu fēn gōng sī nà bian yǒu ge huì yì xū yào zǒng bù de rén cān jiā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "麻烦你跑一趟。",
      "traditional": "麻煩你跑一趟。",
      "pinyin": "má fan nǐ pǎo yí tàng",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Little Zhang, the Hangzhou branch has a conference that someone from headquarters must attend."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Could you please attend it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "小张：好的。会议是什么时候？",
      "traditional": "小張：好的。會議是什麼時候？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng hǎo de huì yì shì shén me shí hou",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Sure. When is the conference?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "王总：下个月1号。等会儿我把会议的邮件转发给你。",
      "traditional": "王總：下個月1號。等會兒我把會議的郵件轉發給你。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng xià ge yuè 1 hào děng huì'r wǒ bǎ huì yì de yóu jiàn zhuǎn fā gěi nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: The first of next month. Wait a minute and I'll forward the conference email to you."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "小张：好的，谢谢王总。",
      "traditional": "小張：好的，謝謝王總。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng hǎo de xiè xie wáng zǒng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Ok. Thank you, manager Wang."
    }
  ],
